    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Reth 2.9.0：节点配置可沿用，自定义执行组件仍要迁移</title>
      <link>https://xiuqiu-site.vercel.app/radar/2026-11-02#web3-reth-evm2-sdk-boundary</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">xiuqiu-radar:web3-reth-evm2-sdk-boundary</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>WEB3</category>
      <category>onchain_infrastructure</category>
